        {"when": "1679 to 1685", "title": "Stellenbosch and Constantia", "text": "Commander Simon van der Stel founded Stellenbosch in 1679, the colony's second town, and in 1685 was granted Constantia, where he planted a large vineyard and made wine for the Company and the passing fleets.", "lat": -34.0304, "lon": 18.4176},
