        {"when": "1918", "title": "The KWV", "text": "The Koöperatieve Wijnbouwers Vereniging van Zuid-Afrika (KWV) was founded at Paarl in 1918 to stabilise prices in a glutted market. Statutory powers from 1924 and a quota system from 1957 let it control prices and plantings until the 1990s.", "lat": -33.7602, "lon": 18.9672},
